WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:09.216 --> 00:00:13.954
♫♫

00:00:12.186 --> 00:00:14.588
&gt;&gt; Tucker: BILL DeBLASIO ENJOYS

00:00:14.087 --> 00:00:15.589
FLYING AROUND HIS CITY BY

00:00:14.721 --> 00:00:17.057
HELICOPTER.

00:00:15.722 --> 00:00:17.424
BUT HE’S A TRUE WARRIORS FOR THE

00:00:17.191 --> 00:00:19.993
CLIMATE.

00:00:17.558 --> 00:00:21.428
YOU CAN TELL BECAUSE HE’S USING

00:00:20.127 --> 00:00:23.297
TAXPAYER MONEY TO SUE OIL

00:00:21.562 --> 00:00:25.666
COMPANIES OVER CLIMATE CHANGE.

00:00:23.430 --> 00:00:28.469
PUTTING OTHER PEOPLE’S MONEY

00:00:25.799 --> 00:00:32.273
WHERE HIS MOUTH IS.

00:00:28.602 --> 00:00:33.174
KEN SAYS IT’S OKAY TO BREAK THE

00:00:32.406 --> 00:00:34.208
LAW FOR THE SAKE OF CLIMATE

00:00:33.307 --> 00:00:35.342
CHANGE.

00:00:34.341 --> 00:00:37.912
THANKS FOR BEING ON.

00:00:35.476 --> 00:00:39.613
&gt;&gt; THANKS FOR HAVING ME.

00:00:38.045 --> 00:00:42.416
I HEARD YOU CALL SOMEBODY, WHAT

00:00:39.747 --> 00:00:43.451
WAS IT, DEMAGOGUE, LITTLE --

00:00:42.550 --> 00:00:44.885
&gt;&gt; Tucker: THAT WAS THEN, THIS

00:00:43.584 --> 00:00:46.454
IS NOW, KEN.

00:00:45.019 --> 00:00:48.089
TOTALLY DIFFERENT SEGMENT,

00:00:46.587 --> 00:00:48.389
DIFFERENT GUEST, GLAD TO SEE

00:00:48.222 --> 00:00:49.090
YOU.

00:00:48.522 --> 00:00:50.658
&gt;&gt; WONDER WHAT I GOT MYSELF

00:00:49.223 --> 00:00:54.495
INTO.

00:00:50.791 --> 00:00:57.031
&gt;&gt; Tucker: NO, NO, NO.

00:00:54.629 --> 00:00:58.599
LET ME ASK YOU THIS, I WON’T

00:00:57.165 --> 00:00:59.300
CALL THAT YOU OR HOPEFULLY

00:00:58.733 --> 00:01:00.668
ANYONE ELSE THAT EVER AGAIN.

00:00:59.434 --> 00:01:03.037
&gt;&gt; THANK YOU.

00:01:00.802 --> 00:01:04.072
&gt;&gt; Tucker: WHY CAN THE MAYOR OF

00:01:03.171 --> 00:01:05.473
NEW YORK CALL HIMSELF A WARRIOR

00:01:04.205 --> 00:01:06.941
AGAINST CLIMATE CHANGE IF HE

00:01:05.607 --> 00:01:08.042
USES A HELICOPTER TO GET AROUND

00:01:07.075 --> 00:01:09.143
THE CITY?

00:01:08.176 --> 00:01:09.611
WHEN HE COULD TAKE PUBLIC

00:01:09.277 --> 00:01:12.947
TRANSPORTATION?

00:01:09.744 --> 00:01:18.019
&gt;&gt; WELL, YOU KNOW, KEY GET THOSE

00:01:13.081 --> 00:01:20.121
QUESTIONS ALL THE TIME.

00:01:18.153 --> 00:01:21.656
IT IS A VERY FAIR QUESTION.

00:01:20.255 --> 00:01:24.059
I JUST THINK WE’RE TRYING TO

00:01:21.790 --> 00:01:25.260
CHANGE AN ENTIRE SYSTEM HERE,

00:01:24.192 --> 00:01:28.096
PARTLY CAN YOU DO THAT BY YOUR

00:01:25.393 --> 00:01:29.464
OWN BEHAVIORS.

00:01:28.230 --> 00:01:31.433
THAT’S EXEMPLARY.

00:01:29.598 --> 00:01:32.868
I WOULD THINK ANYBODY WHO’S

00:01:31.566 --> 00:01:34.703
CONCERNED ABOUT CLIMATE CHANGE

00:01:34.836 --> 00:01:37.739
THEIR OWN CARBON IMPACT.

00:01:36.605 --> 00:01:39.174
AT THE SAME TIME, WE’RE TRYING

00:01:37.873 --> 00:01:40.442
TO ACHIEVE POLITICAL CHANGE IN

00:01:39.307 --> 00:01:43.445
AMERICA AS IT IS.

00:01:40.575 --> 00:01:44.646
AND IT’S HARD TO DO THAT WITHOUT

00:01:43.578 --> 00:01:47.182
BURN SOMETHING FOSSIL FUELS.

00:01:44.780 --> 00:01:48.250
&gt;&gt; Tucker: I UNDERSTAND THAT.

00:01:47.316 --> 00:01:49.651
THERE ARE PRACTICAL LIMITS TO

00:01:48.383 --> 00:01:51.220
PEOPLE’S ABILITY TO LIVE OUT

00:01:49.785 --> 00:01:53.255
THEIR BELIEFS.

00:01:51.353 --> 00:01:55.557
BUT DO I THINK IT CALLS INTO

00:01:53.388 --> 00:01:57.059
QUESTION THE SINCERITY OF A

00:01:55.691 --> 00:01:58.961
PERSON WHOO’S FRAME LITTLE

00:01:57.192 --> 00:02:01.263
DEBATE IN MORAL TERMS IF HE

00:01:59.094 --> 00:02:04.600
FALLS SO FAR SHORT F I’M A

00:02:01.397 --> 00:02:05.367
SHOEXMAN FOR PETA BUT OPERATE A

00:02:04.733 --> 00:02:06.535
SLAUGHTER HOUSE ON THE SIDE I’M

00:02:05.501 --> 00:02:08.537
LESS BELIEVABLE.

00:02:06.669 --> 00:02:09.905
&gt;&gt; THAT MAKES SENSE.

00:02:08.671 --> 00:02:13.209
I DON’T THINK CLIMATE CHANGE IS

00:02:10.039 --> 00:02:14.176
FRAMED IN MORAL TERMS.

00:02:13.342 --> 00:02:17.580
IT’S PUT IN PRACTICAL, PRAGMATIC

00:02:14.310 --> 00:02:21.484
TERMS.

00:02:17.713 --> 00:02:22.952
WE’RE FACING THE CATACLYSMIC

00:02:21.617 --> 00:02:25.354
CLIMATE CHANGE.

00:02:23.085 --> 00:02:26.355
THAT HAS MORAL IMPLICATIONS BUT

00:02:25.488 --> 00:02:28.591
PRACTICAL LIVING IMPLICATIONS.

00:02:26.489 --> 00:02:32.261
&gt;&gt; Tucker: RIGHT.

00:02:28.724 --> 00:02:33.663
SO HOW IS IT THAT IN PURSUIT OF

00:02:32.395 --> 00:02:34.564
LIVING OUT YOUR OPINIONS ON

00:02:33.796 --> 00:02:37.834
CLIMATE CHANGE YOU BELIEVE YOU

00:02:34.697 --> 00:02:38.234
OUGHT TO BE ALLOWED TO VIOLATE

00:02:37.967 --> 00:02:40.169
THE LAW?

00:02:38.368 --> 00:02:40.970
&gt;&gt; I’M NOT SURE I’D SAY I WANT

00:02:40.303 --> 00:02:43.473
TO BE ALLOWED TO VIOLATE THE

00:02:41.104 --> 00:02:46.943
LAW.

00:02:43.606 --> 00:02:50.080
WHAT I BELIEVE, IS THAT IN

00:02:47.076 --> 00:02:51.381
TAKING THE ACTIONS, SUCH AS WE

00:02:50.213 --> 00:02:53.850
RECENTLY DID, WHEN WE FACE

00:02:51.514 --> 00:02:56.019
CHARGES AND WHEN WE GO TO COURT,

00:02:53.984 --> 00:02:58.855
IT IS APPROPRIATE FOR US TO BE

00:02:56.152 --> 00:03:00.890
ABLE TO SMAN TO THE JURY WHY WE

00:02:58.989 --> 00:03:03.226
DID, WHAT WE DID.

00:03:01.024 --> 00:03:05.762
AND TO BE ABLE TO CALL SOME

00:03:03.360 --> 00:03:06.463
EXPERT WITH ITS THAT WOULD

00:03:05.896 --> 00:03:08.832
TESTIFY TO THE FACTS AS WE

00:03:06.596 --> 00:03:10.667
UNDERSTAND THEM.

00:03:08.965 --> 00:03:12.202
&gt;&gt; Tucker: BUT THAT’S NOT, I

00:03:10.801 --> 00:03:13.837
MEAN, THAT’S NOT REALLY AN ACT

00:03:12.335 --> 00:03:14.971
OF CONSCIENCE.

00:03:13.970 --> 00:03:17.641
TYPICALLY WHEN PEOPLE PROTEST

00:03:15.105 --> 00:03:19.876
WHAT THEY THINK IS AN UNJUST

00:03:17.774 --> 00:03:21.144
SYSTEM AND ARE PUNISHED FOR IT,

00:03:20.010 --> 00:03:22.713
THEY SAY PART OF THE ACTION,

00:03:21.278 --> 00:03:23.480
PART OF THE REASON IT’S A NOBLE

00:03:22.846 --> 00:03:24.748
ACTION, IS BECAUSE THEY ACCEPT

00:03:23.614 --> 00:03:25.983
THE CONSEQUENCES.

00:03:24.881 --> 00:03:27.518
YES, I KNOW IT’S AGAINST THE

00:03:26.116 --> 00:03:28.452
LAW, I DID IT ANYWAY.

00:03:27.651 --> 00:03:31.588
WHY DON’T DO YOU THAT?

00:03:28.585 --> 00:03:33.424
&gt;&gt; I’M NOT TRYING TO GET OFF

00:03:31.722 --> 00:03:35.526
HERE, CERTAINLY ANYBODY ENGAGES

00:03:33.557 --> 00:03:37.995
IN DIRECT ACTION, IF YOU’RE

00:03:35.659 --> 00:03:40.264
GOING TO STAND THERE AND GET

00:03:38.128 --> 00:03:40.998
ARRESTED, WITH THE EXPECTATION

00:03:40.397 --> 00:03:41.999
THAT YOU MAY WELL BE PUNISHED

00:03:41.131 --> 00:03:43.968
FOR IT.

00:03:42.132 --> 00:03:45.236
IN THE ACTION THAT I DID, AFTER

00:03:44.101 --> 00:03:47.371
TWO TRIALS, I WAS CONVICTED OF

00:03:45.369 --> 00:03:49.440
BURGLARY.

00:03:47.505 --> 00:03:51.942
I’M NOT PROTESTING BURGLARY, I

00:03:49.573 --> 00:03:53.310
HAVE HAD MY HOUSE BROKEN INTO,

00:03:52.076 --> 00:03:55.546
BURGLARY LAWS ARE GOOD.

00:03:53.444 --> 00:03:56.947
ALL I’M SAYING, I’D LIKE TO BE

00:03:55.680 --> 00:03:59.583
ABLE TO EXPLAIN TO THE JURY WHY

00:03:57.081 --> 00:04:02.053
I DID WHAT I DID AND CALL SOME

00:03:59.717 --> 00:04:03.921
EXPERTS THEN IT’S UP TO THEM.

00:04:02.186 --> 00:04:04.455
THE JURY CAN DECIDE.

00:04:04.055 --> 00:04:06.357
I’VE NOW SAID --

00:04:04.589 --> 00:04:07.825
&gt;&gt; Tucker: I UNDERSTAND THAT.

00:04:06.491 --> 00:04:10.661
BUT DOES THIS, DO YOU THINK,

00:04:07.959 --> 00:04:13.598
APPLY TO OTHERS, DO YOU THINK

00:04:10.795 --> 00:04:16.901
THE GUY WHO SHOT GEORGE TILLER,

00:04:13.731 --> 00:04:17.769
ABORTIONIST, ANYONE SHOT BY

00:04:17.035 --> 00:04:19.504
ANTI-ABORTIONISTS, OUGHT TO

00:04:17.902 --> 00:04:21.372
EXPLAIN THEIR POSITION TO THE

00:04:19.637 --> 00:04:21.973
JURY AND THAT WOULD BE

00:04:21.506 --> 00:04:23.441
EXCULPATORY?

00:04:22.106 --> 00:04:24.976
&gt;&gt; I DO NOT THINK IT SHOULD BE

00:04:23.575 --> 00:04:28.513
AN EASY PROCESS BY ANY MEANS.

00:04:25.109 --> 00:04:30.548
IT IS A DIFFICULT ONE.

00:04:28.646 --> 00:04:32.250
RARELY DO JUDGES ALLOW

00:04:30.682 --> 00:04:34.119
PRESENTING A NECESSITY DEFENSE.

00:04:32.384 --> 00:04:36.888
IF YOU DO PRESENT A NECESSITY

00:04:34.252 --> 00:04:38.223
DEFENSE, THERE ARE REALLY HIGH

00:04:37.022 --> 00:04:40.091
HURDLES THAT YOU HAVE TO -- I

00:04:38.356 --> 00:04:42.294
THINK THAT IS APPROPRIATE.

00:04:40.225 --> 00:04:43.795
&gt;&gt; Tucker: DO YOU THINK

00:04:42.427 --> 00:04:45.630
ANTI-ABORTION ACTIVISTS SHOULD

00:04:43.929 --> 00:04:47.766
ABE LOUED TO DO THAT?

00:04:45.764 --> 00:04:48.466
&gt;&gt; WELL, FIRST OF ALL THE

00:04:47.899 --> 00:04:51.369
EXAMPLE THAT YOU MENTION WAS

00:04:48.600 --> 00:04:53.105
VIOLENT.

00:04:51.503 --> 00:04:54.272
I’M COMMITTED TO NONVIOLENCE.

00:04:53.238 --> 00:04:54.606
&gt;&gt; Tucker: HOW ABOUT BLOCKING A

00:04:54.406 --> 00:04:58.043
CLINIC?

00:04:54.740 --> 00:05:00.479
&gt;&gt; BLOCKING A CLINIC, I THINK IF

00:04:58.176 --> 00:05:02.814
PEOPLE BELIEVE THIS IS WHAT --

00:05:00.612 --> 00:05:04.082
ACTUALLY, I THINK THE PRO-LIFE

00:05:02.948 --> 00:05:07.786
MOVEMENT IS PRETTY COMPARABLE IN

00:05:04.216 --> 00:05:12.624
A LOT OF WAYS TO THE POLITICAL

00:05:07.920 --> 00:05:15.527
SITUATION THAT CLIMATE ACTIVISTS

00:05:12.758 --> 00:05:16.462
FACE, INSOLUBLE PROBLEM THAT

00:05:15.661 --> 00:05:18.464
MAINSTREAM POLITICS, BOTH

00:05:16.595 --> 00:05:20.699
PARTIES, AREN’T DEALING WITH.

00:05:18.597 --> 00:05:21.400
THAT IS THE CLASSIC SITUATION.

00:05:20.833 --> 00:05:23.102
&gt;&gt; Tucker: THAT SEEMS LIKE A

00:05:21.533 --> 00:05:23.969
FAIR POSITION.

